ce.</div><p>Fonts at the same size don’t always look the same size. <code>font-size-adjust</code> balances their lowercase letter heights, making mixed typography feel more consistent.</p><a class="learn" href="https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/font-size-adjust" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Get to know font-size-adjust <span>↗</span></a></div></aside>
